  m_Name: 4 - Black Ore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UtilityScriptIWrite::HintSO
  hintId: tutorial_black_ore
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Black Ore
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: "<b>Black Ore</b>\n\nBlack Ore is a dangerous mineral that emits malicious
    energy and must be handled carefully.\n\nBefore mining it, the ore must first
    be purified using purify().\n\nAfter purification, Black Ore can be processed
    like other ores by using mine() followed by collect().\n\nMining Black Ore without
    purifying it first will cause the ore to explode, damaging the robot and reducing
    the ore\u2019s value by half."
  isImageBig: 0
